  "editorReview": {
    "text": "This biography excels in its forensic integration of person and system, using ledgers, cables, and inventories to make institutional procedure itself the engine of the story. The dramatic tension in scenes like the vault inventory is masterfully achieved without melodrama. However, the prose rhythm can occasionally flatten into a procedural drone, with an over-reliance on em-dashes and repetitive sentence openings that dull the narrative drive at pivotal moments. The book's great strength lies in showing, not just telling, how power mechanisms work, even if some later chapters briefly lapse in",
